# The lecture documents, the issued exercise notebooks and the reference
# notebooks are the course authors' files, held exactly as downloaded. Never
# reformat them. A format-on-save rewrote 1,164 lines of
# lectures/01_use-case.html on 31 August 2026, which buries any real change in a
# whitespace diff and destroys the byte-for-byte comparison against the original.
#
# Scoped to the HTML rather than to lectures/ as a whole, because Prettier reads
# gitignore semantics: excluding a directory stops the walk, so a later
# `!lectures/lecture.css` would never re-include our own stylesheet.
lectures/*.html
exercises/
reference/
